    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Your niche\n**Edit `Your niche` once.**\n\n- `business`: one line on what you sell\n- `niche`: the phrase people search on TikTok\n- `hashtag`: the Instagram tag, no #\n- `markets`: keep TikTok picks from these countries\n- `language`: keep picks in this language\n- `transcripts`: how many top videos to read (0-3, 200 credits each)\n\nRuns every weekday at 8am. Use **Run now** to try it.",
        "height": 800,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "e7517952-5bba-5d5d-a372-236bff49c923",
      "name": "Note: setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. This week's top videos\n**One InsightSocial key.**\nTikTok's Top tab for your phrase, kept to your markets, and the Instagram Reels on your hashtag from the last 7 days, both sorted by views.\n\n20 + 100 credits. Failed calls and empty results cost nothing.",
        "height": 800,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "ab261cf2-c6d9-5f8f-bef1-423ce695c2f8",
      "name": "Note: data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        -180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Rank and flag\nTop 5 TikToks and top 3 Reels by views.\n\nFlags **comment-for-link funnels** (their comment counts are manufactured) and **paid ads** so the brief does not copy the wrong thing.",
        "height": 800,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "a20e4087-b63d-518c-8fce-381cc21e3c95",
      "name": "Note: rank",
